Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 05:58:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] NE2000: the card keeps the last MAC it adopted through its
 own reset (a DOS driver read the PROM before the refetch and got the built-in
 address; seen on hardware); OSD Netplay [70:69] (read by Main);
 tb_ne2000_mac_reset
